<body>
<div type="letter">


<pb facs="1039280" n="2v"/>
  <note hand="pers_DE-588-119166895">Ad <rs type="person"><abbr>Joh.</abbr> Jacobum Zörnlinum</rs>, <rs type="place">Sangallum</rs>.</note>
  <p><lb/>Monitu Amicissimi Domini <rs key="pers_DE-588-1012090132" type="person">Ritsii</rs> istam ad te exaro epistolam, <rs key="pers_resource_000069" type="person">Zörnline</rs> optime, hac spe fretus, te

      <lb/>illam utut ab ignoto venientem homine benigno tamen animo accepturum, et desiderium meum
      <lb/>circa numerum demortuorum, de quo forte jam tecum co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>unicavit <rs key="pers_DE-588-1012090132" type="person">Ritsius</rs> noster dilectus, haud
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gre expleturum esse. Humanissime igitur abs te peto, velis numerum mortuorum, initio <date>seculi
      <lb/>decimi septimi</date> <abbr>h. e.</abbr> anno <date>1600</date><choice><orig>.</orig><reg>,</reg></choice> <date>1601<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice></date> vel <date>1610</date> <abbr><choice><orig><g ref="#pp">ꝛc.</g></orig><reg>etc.</reg></choice></abbr> natorum, in <rs type="biblio">catalogum</rs> rejicere; talem <rs type="biblio">catalogum</rs>
      <lb/>pro anno <date>1630</date><choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> et <date>1640</date><choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> <abbr>Dno</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1012090132" type="person">Ritsio</rs> accepi, sed remoram injicit, quod quidam qui eis annis na<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>

      <lb break="no"/>ti sunt adhuc vivunt, vellem enim cujusque <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tatem, quam vivendo attigit, scire, ut dein
      <lb/>possem long<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>vitatem vit<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> human<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> pro singulis annis per artem conjecturandi aliquo mo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>

      <lb break="no"/>do supputare. Laborem quem hac in re sustinebis decenti honorario remunerabor, gratum<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que animum per mutui officii redhostimenta, si qua se occasio pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>buerit, tibi testat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>faciam. Hisce, quia tempus me deficit, valere te volo quam optime, et ut me inter
      <lb/>Amicos tuos inposterum numerare velis obsecro.</p>
</div>
